{"id": "nat_0", "text": "The birch canoe slid on the smooth planks.", "audio_duration_s": 2.414875283446712, "utmos": 4.152072906494141, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.031048728568742, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4351167748956466, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7263881067370423}
{"id": "nat_1", "text": "Glue the sheet to the dark blue background.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.308299541473389, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.354363774307002, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6002385409727373, "dnsmos_bak": 4.167947603382771}
{"id": "nat_2", "text": "It is easy to tell the depth of a well.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.3385844230651855, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3604228154275906, "dnsmos_sig": 3.608791386867118, "dnsmos_bak": 4.15259267616251}
{"id": "nat_3", "text": "These days a chicken leg is a rare dish.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.4612812995910645, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4115455942870416, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6181048138700036, "dnsmos_bak": 4.134976447880169}
{"id": "nat_4", "text": "Rice is often served in round bowls.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.332231521606445, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.359678755122252, "dnsmos_sig": 3.63675579805277, "dnsmos_bak": 4.0784942709414995}
{"id": "nat_5", "text": "The juice of lemons makes fine punch.", "audio_duration_s": 2.36843537414966, "utmos": 4.289813041687012, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1873362845925066, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4931174306915063, "dnsmos_bak": 3.986612442681116}
{"id": "nat_6", "text": "The box was thrown beside the parked truck.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.239491939544678, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.030187842169151, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4311514093266964, "dnsmos_bak": 3.85582304921492}
{"id": "nat_7", "text": "The hogs were fed chopped corn and garbage.", "audio_duration_s": 2.5541950113378684, "utmos": 4.273902893066406, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.284788353528266, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5351144643135433, "dnsmos_bak": 4.129910683427572}
{"id": "nat_8", "text": "Four hours of steady work faced us.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.129426002502441, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3335553118740378, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5909155938160997, "dnsmos_bak": 4.125808038876638}
{"id": "nat_9", "text": "Large size in stockings is hard to sell.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 3.8092668056488037, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4213469902807856, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6779633917329226, "dnsmos_bak": 4.149042724520195}
{"id": "nat_10", "text": "The boy was there when the sun rose.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7182766439909296, "utmos": 3.587007761001587, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1498960120614488, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4985576134380816, "dnsmos_bak": 3.915820261361457}
{"id": "nat_11", "text": "A rod is used to catch pink salmon.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.255695343017578, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2826759849470872, "dnsmos_sig": 3.54192831211412, "dnsmos_bak": 4.099475097984402}
{"id": "nat_12", "text": "The source of the huge river is the clear spring.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.364371299743652, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.13577326350839, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5217052670654803, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8305320071452886}
{"id": "nat_13", "text": "Kick the ball straight and follow through.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.183403491973877, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4051007189630336, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6629639679923334, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1329751791354985}
{"id": "nat_14", "text": "Help the woman get back to her feet.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7182766439909296, "utmos": 3.9536571502685547, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1614789776311634, "dnsmos_sig": 3.516501190573521, "dnsmos_bak": 3.995803223369789}
{"id": "nat_15", "text": "A blue crane is a tall wading bird.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.380937099456787, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0741424161541313, "dnsmos_sig": 3.523501067891313, "dnsmos_bak": 3.738625086608324}
{"id": "nat_16", "text": "It is hard to erase blue or red ink.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 3.7606875896453857, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0802792878980787, "dnsmos_sig": 3.384919984522998, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9721962799945345}
{"id": "nat_17", "text": "Write quickly and meet me at the dock.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7182766439909296, "utmos": 4.112869739532471, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3422803240795664, "dnsmos_sig": 3.586145149731384, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1326854716225565}
{"id": "nat_18", "text": "The two talked quietly in the dim light.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.274574279785156, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.120247376242972, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4736061732529175, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8789142323121717}
{"id": "nat_19", "text": "The hail pattered on the burnt red tiles.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 3.83793568611145, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2185234385651387, "dnsmos_sig": 3.527845023819012, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9828108249606524}
{"id": "nat_20", "text": "The sand drifted down the steep slope.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.25669002532959, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3127995494788167, "dnsmos_sig": 3.553534628890869, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1308794766341626}
{"id": "nat_21", "text": "Oak is strong and also gives shade.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.012191295623779, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9927549733425987, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3701321914218343, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8554570632922553}
{"id": "nat_22", "text": "Cats and dogs each hate the other.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.3373212814331055, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.164842232510002, "dnsmos_sig": 3.512012935204917, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9717173370904275}
{"id": "nat_23", "text": "The pipe began to rust while new.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7182766439909296, "utmos": 4.388479232788086, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.310855003351754, "dnsmos_sig": 3.578148232090836, "dnsmos_bak": 4.120507060869032}
{"id": "nat_24", "text": "Open the crate but don't break the glass.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.078145980834961, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.398445300458668, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6435129216047026, "dnsmos_bak": 4.182558811016597}
{"id": "nat_25", "text": "Add the sum to the product of these three.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.149707794189453, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.5661671724331314, "dnsmos_sig": 3.771843537034308, "dnsmos_bak": 4.22635095140109}
{"id": "nat_26", "text": "Thieves who rob friends deserve jail.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.332698822021484, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2393887257953353, "dnsmos_sig": 3.553750321582115, "dnsmos_bak": 4.045077299438708}
{"id": "nat_27", "text": "The ripe taste of cheese improves with age.", "audio_duration_s": 2.5541950113378684, "utmos": 3.8283143043518066, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.059406906452356, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4529187592001556, "dnsmos_bak": 3.796863395060676}
{"id": "nat_28", "text": "Act on these orders with great speed.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 3.830705165863037, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.178023363969873, "dnsmos_sig": 3.42529009316776, "dnsmos_bak": 4.113480261354408}
{"id": "nat_29", "text": "The hush of night came on the water.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7182766439909296, "utmos": 3.93241024017334, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2397204828511184, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5986952837133614, "dnsmos_bak": 3.949496548809231}
{"id": "nat_30", "text": "Flax makes linen for many a dress.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 3.915534257888794, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.343593508893909, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5892696536226056, "dnsmos_bak": 4.096042315884385}
{"id": "nat_31", "text": "Hoist the load to your left shoulder.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.108835220336914, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.002189728054591, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3652164145374996, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8670872126799303}
{"id": "nat_32", "text": "Take the winding path to reach the lake.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.312403678894043, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3400791661144944, "dnsmos_sig": 3.58159871365339, "dnsmos_bak": 4.159720552440658}
{"id": "nat_33", "text": "Note closely the size of the gas tank.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.322756767272949, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.362557928403328, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6202709903189976, "dnsmos_bak": 4.137031987411012}
{"id": "nat_34", "text": "Wipe the grease off his dirty face.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.249424934387207, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.274484636681207, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5290481466592643, "dnsmos_bak": 4.170111772843724}
{"id": "nat_35", "text": "Mend the coat before wearing it again.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.3279643058776855, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2401828037599447, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5257762728772835, "dnsmos_bak": 4.083640245407731}
{"id": "nat_36", "text": "The lease ran out in sixteen weeks.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.341187000274658, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.355614360278642, "dnsmos_sig": 3.617030594122895, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1436047477804765}
{"id": "nat_37", "text": "Both parts of the design came together.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.271170616149902, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2222378229959894, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5084191554418482, "dnsmos_bak": 4.04420607214764}
{"id": "nat_38", "text": "Sewing hems and darns takes skill.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.255519390106201, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.293033722470487, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5528521573470564, "dnsmos_bak": 4.116745181850834}
{"id": "nat_39", "text": "The architect planned a new city hall.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.312891006469727, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.5489567797071837, "dnsmos_sig": 3.753993798608367, "dnsmos_bak": 4.204916772793211}
{"id": "nat_40", "text": "The small red lamp stood in a corner.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.206745147705078, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.319858969717562, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6031793271029966, "dnsmos_bak": 4.121441986550864}
{"id": "nat_41", "text": "The large box came by truck to town.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.155267715454102, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4452379220206404, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6729825212896885, "dnsmos_bak": 4.170066954275686}
{"id": "nat_42", "text": "The men fought hard to save the fort.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.188320159912109, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.256961510419046, "dnsmos_sig": 3.542501055309411, "dnsmos_bak": 4.117276063345498}
{"id": "nat_43", "text": "The horse chewed his bit and nodded.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.281258583068848, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.961532094539411, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2814863496695788, "dnsmos_bak": 3.87975703971545}
{"id": "nat_44", "text": "Three of the men were hurt badly.", "audio_duration_s": 1.6718367346938776, "utmos": 4.221153736114502, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.199853118571527, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5102069611583837, "dnsmos_bak": 4.049142095867062}
{"id": "nat_45", "text": "Ripe pears are fit for a queen's table.", "audio_duration_s": 2.36843537414966, "utmos": 4.378378868103027, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2907017628878554, "dnsmos_sig": 3.541567160664154, "dnsmos_bak": 4.174805278371993}
{"id": "nat_46", "text": "The dark room was lit by a red light.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.152950286865234, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3049978102601383, "dnsmos_sig": 3.565983084712767, "dnsmos_bak": 4.134795092284532}
{"id": "nat_47", "text": "The fox hid in the tall grass nearby.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 3.740596055984497, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2829877901547415, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5622961063866176, "dnsmos_bak": 4.0853122896363105}
{"id": "nat_48", "text": "We saw eight tiny goats on the hillside.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.227443218231201, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.350605386076415, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6025146953262874, "dnsmos_bak": 4.107476140321887}
{"id": "nat_49", "text": "The cats purred softly on the warm rug.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.303185939788818, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.403993012988221, "dnsmos_sig": 3.660719037319454, "dnsmos_bak": 4.158599364082069}
{"id": "nat_50", "text": "The silver bell rang at dawn.", "audio_duration_s": 1.6253968253968254, "utmos": 4.22813081741333, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4099258334713167, "dnsmos_sig": 3.678753205428179, "dnsmos_bak": 4.164379608690446}
{"id": "nat_51", "text": "The crowd cheered the band with pride.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.312617301940918, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3095382545375083, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5589815046936906, "dnsmos_bak": 4.124419647794312}
{"id": "nat_52", "text": "She baked fresh bread every morning.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.197771072387695, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1957905414225642, "dnsmos_sig": 3.497710253599397, "dnsmos_bak": 4.047141480407777}
{"id": "nat_53", "text": "The train reached the bridge at noon.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7647165532879818, "utmos": 4.313140869140625, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3165003186553053, "dnsmos_sig": 3.560135426075365, "dnsmos_bak": 4.139717447163671}
{"id": "nat_54", "text": "Cool winds blew from the distant peaks.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.229901313781738, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3066793105661683, "dnsmos_sig": 3.548205492772138, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1530681864211445}
{"id": "nat_55", "text": "The old dog slept by the warm fire.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.275846004486084, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.260331480352373, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5297645147706427, "dnsmos_bak": 4.127576683250213}
{"id": "nat_56", "text": "Bright stars filled the clear night sky.", "audio_duration_s": 2.36843537414966, "utmos": 4.304571151733398, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.190616602290843, "dnsmos_sig": 3.51677020797948, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9753243454630445}
{"id": "nat_57", "text": "The child built a castle in the sand.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 3.8073723316192627, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.274747600005604, "dnsmos_sig": 3.590646548880125, "dnsmos_bak": 4.011497692538145}
{"id": "nat_58", "text": "Rain soaked the dry and barren plain.", "audio_duration_s": 2.36843537414966, "utmos": 3.741340160369873, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.836581203798197, "dnsmos_sig": 3.2775045560824503, "dnsmos_bak": 3.6594519869140374}
{"id": "nat_59", "text": "The boat moved quietly past the shore.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.185067176818848, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.353136299096469, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6016016486428617, "dnsmos_bak": 4.144580539133939}
{"id": "nat_60", "text": "Plums ripen in the warm summer sun.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 3.8838512897491455, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.297231045079548, "dnsmos_sig": 3.589309476977934, "dnsmos_bak": 4.082232177332091}
{"id": "nat_61", "text": "The lock was jammed but opened at last.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.387331485748291, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.188529324221233, "dnsmos_sig": 3.489091516049994, "dnsmos_bak": 4.034262802808086}
{"id": "nat_62", "text": "The key to the cabinet was misplaced.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.30894660949707, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.7726626891322, "dnsmos_sig": 3.1505235851229885, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7684147674256288}
{"id": "nat_63", "text": "The cup shattered on the stone floor.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 3.9747612476348877, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.139798313217279, "dnsmos_sig": 3.494906971813812, "dnsmos_bak": 3.898526222822538}
{"id": "nat_64", "text": "A black bear crossed the narrow trail.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 3.628734588623047, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3035292219569254, "dnsmos_sig": 3.55667255202444, "dnsmos_bak": 4.149792068982064}
{"id": "nat_65", "text": "Fresh dew glistened on the green leaves.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.214642524719238, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.073547515480907, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4640310696919543, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7708360572079296}
{"id": "nat_66", "text": "The lamp cast a soft glow on the table.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.2602925300598145, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3715603641298078, "dnsmos_sig": 3.64718692911225, "dnsmos_bak": 4.157418581115838}
{"id": "nat_67", "text": "Strong winds bent the tall pine trees.", "audio_duration_s": 2.36843537414966, "utmos": 4.424973011016846, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.5046740620335837, "dnsmos_sig": 3.717182748363555, "dnsmos_bak": 4.211710853200249}
{"id": "nat_68", "text": "A robin sang from the old oak branch.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.2522430419921875, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2763089269097514, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5765219127613372, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9995484707592754}
{"id": "nat_69", "text": "The crowd fell silent when he spoke.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7647165532879818, "utmos": 4.149162292480469, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1930354207589433, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4848376747591217, "dnsmos_bak": 4.073747130511931}
{"id": "nat_70", "text": "Green fields stretched to the far horizon.", "audio_duration_s": 2.414875283446712, "utmos": 4.333104133605957, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.350773764014068, "dnsmos_sig": 3.632798807603764, "dnsmos_bak": 4.040298971305996}
{"id": "nat_71", "text": "The river ran swift and cold today.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.154117584228516, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.153650661074945, "dnsmos_sig": 3.496027689295861, "dnsmos_bak": 3.922635177150301}
{"id": "nat_72", "text": "The flag waved high in the morning breeze.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.2396745681762695, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2667084413576504, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5161210025820333, "dnsmos_bak": 4.089178197256204}
{"id": "nat_73", "text": "Blue jays flew low over the meadow.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.157820224761963, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2507172869247527, "dnsmos_sig": 3.540809939177296, "dnsmos_bak": 4.042558603438714}
{"id": "nat_74", "text": "The forge was lit at break of day.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.404300212860107, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2682296175971772, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5586376584090638, "dnsmos_bak": 4.082101675591383}
{"id": "nat_75", "text": "The sparrows hopped on the garden wall.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.115978717803955, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1028656922651763, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3931117048346757, "dnsmos_bak": 3.992343774050343}
{"id": "nat_76", "text": "Fill the car before you drive into town.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.2444353103637695, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.242304546852012, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5433474704356143, "dnsmos_bak": 4.004043076630572}
{"id": "nat_77", "text": "A cud of grass hung from the heifer's lip.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.246877670288086, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.422268060578584, "dnsmos_sig": 3.69987026533368, "dnsmos_bak": 4.103922789554899}
{"id": "nat_78", "text": "The seed grew into a giant oak tree.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.4215826988220215, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.204833106359708, "dnsmos_sig": 3.541102945866387, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9854094158982085}
{"id": "nat_79", "text": "A worm ate through the wooden plank.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 3.975940704345703, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1252190986358133, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4253600494127245, "dnsmos_bak": 4.048735686030571}
{"id": "nat_80", "text": "The team scored in the last few seconds.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.341854572296143, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3760218311989627, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6033648558653937, "dnsmos_bak": 4.153220407334451}
{"id": "nat_81", "text": "The glass jar held the bright red jam.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.240987300872803, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.326222155538541, "dnsmos_sig": 3.604908415973555, "dnsmos_bak": 4.095932680187259}
{"id": "nat_82", "text": "The leaves fell slowly in the autumn air.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.2544684410095215, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0621177267809654, "dnsmos_sig": 3.39807195765276, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9297428177302307}
{"id": "nat_83", "text": "The farmer planted seeds in long rows.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.300567150115967, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3551119150201307, "dnsmos_sig": 3.598863301649266, "dnsmos_bak": 4.157209150816078}
{"id": "nat_84", "text": "The clock struck twelve at midnight.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7647165532879818, "utmos": 4.15097713470459, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2949879806417606, "dnsmos_sig": 3.560890374808197, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1220976269858465}
{"id": "nat_85", "text": "A pale moon rose over the distant hills.", "audio_duration_s": 2.414875283446712, "utmos": 4.326497554779053, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4035863286153005, "dnsmos_sig": 3.62453204137472, "dnsmos_bak": 4.160826512607872}
{"id": "nat_86", "text": "The stream carved a path through the stone.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.397640705108643, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2052131011160236, "dnsmos_sig": 3.500109682298684, "dnsmos_bak": 4.069542257397397}
{"id": "nat_87", "text": "Bright flowers bloomed along the fence.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.215554237365723, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.417880055779432, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6645335523727307, "dnsmos_bak": 4.186474378928951}
{"id": "nat_88", "text": "The snow lay deep on the mountain pass.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.378623008728027, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4274516952170124, "dnsmos_sig": 3.669212216308508, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1684748405667635}
{"id": "nat_89", "text": "The eagle soared above the canyon rim.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 3.3269460201263428, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1322724290380686, "dnsmos_sig": 3.439439501481639, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9570255933527747}
{"id": "nat_90", "text": "The gate swung open with a loud creak.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 3.7702929973602295, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1378548095422327, "dnsmos_sig": 3.449689907679951, "dnsmos_bak": 4.003704804143597}
{"id": "nat_91", "text": "The wolf howled at the cold winter moon.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.058951377868652, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.710027474215044, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4109692786430696, "dnsmos_bak": 3.2287293046613352}
{"id": "nat_92", "text": "A candle flickered in the draft of wind.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.2983198165893555, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4022912017439486, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6951659070486653, "dnsmos_bak": 4.090852157993253}
{"id": "nat_93", "text": "The road curved sharply past the barn.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.331168174743652, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3642149203912624, "dnsmos_sig": 3.593671008233272, "dnsmos_bak": 4.140823386459045}
{"id": "nat_94", "text": "Wool is spun into yarn for warm cloth.", "audio_duration_s": 2.461315192743764, "utmos": 4.3021321296691895, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.329625608880553, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6267398353750373, "dnsmos_bak": 4.094482437371131}
{"id": "nat_95", "text": "The crowd surged through the narrow gate.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.322141647338867, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0175726021719753, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3446850895643085, "dnsmos_bak": 3.893235685637248}
{"id": "nat_96", "text": "The owl hunted mice in the dark field.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.295230865478516, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0495764344835137, "dnsmos_sig": 3.471667529848513, "dnsmos_bak": 3.7719907825235475}
{"id": "nat_97", "text": "The pond froze solid in January.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.416685581207275, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3905462779201017, "dnsmos_sig": 3.7019745348764386, "dnsmos_bak": 4.099193617046342}
{"id": "nat_98", "text": "A flock of geese flew in a V-shape.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.165503978729248, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.438080200661635, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6856653019513317, "dnsmos_bak": 4.125698987456606}
{"id": "nat_99", "text": "The tide ebbed low on the rocky coast.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.045083045959473, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.139696239338266, "dnsmos_sig": 3.483271076480117, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9380770154240943}
{"id": "nat_100", "text": "The flame burned bright in the dark cave.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.398946762084961, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3379802223103403, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5975510272709252, "dnsmos_bak": 4.066088315970603}
{"id": "nat_101", "text": "The mill ground grain into fine flour.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.336688041687012, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4539170112984836, "dnsmos_sig": 3.686084330520054, "dnsmos_bak": 4.188818356007944}
{"id": "nat_102", "text": "The stag grazed near the edge of the wood.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 3.9699058532714844, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.183763072854863, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5603127966360235, "dnsmos_bak": 3.93308323576297}
{"id": "nat_103", "text": "The well dried up in the hot summer.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7647165532879818, "utmos": 4.229488849639893, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3042921910756022, "dnsmos_sig": 3.53208829041377, "dnsmos_bak": 4.179496401264703}
{"id": "nat_104", "text": "The swift brown fox ran past the log.", "audio_duration_s": 2.507755102040816, "utmos": 4.244359016418457, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1837302557005698, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4679756685837435, "dnsmos_bak": 4.06825404552042}
{"id": "nat_105", "text": "A stone wall bordered the old estate.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 3.9494094848632812, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.240180866780337, "dnsmos_sig": 3.592936252757132, "dnsmos_bak": 4.009331853150772}
{"id": "nat_106", "text": "The bell rang twice before it stopped.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.239834785461426, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.28126609646622, "dnsmos_sig": 3.540691260863217, "dnsmos_bak": 4.122300639141761}
{"id": "nat_107", "text": "The hawk soared high on the warm updraft.", "audio_duration_s": 2.507755102040816, "utmos": 4.256322860717773, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4333949013872918, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6679700381977796, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1631104989852235}
{"id": "nat_108", "text": "The sharp knife cut the rough cord.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7647165532879818, "utmos": 4.26702356338501, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3283396082306, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5802355251487183, "dnsmos_bak": 4.140823808295899}
{"id": "nat_109", "text": "The colt pranced in the wide green field.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 3.941317558288574, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.264888210525385, "dnsmos_sig": 3.531141039522275, "dnsmos_bak": 4.107934105214905}
{"id": "nat_110", "text": "A fish leaped from the calm blue lake.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.065420627593994, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0823342779663334, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4159639569301015, "dnsmos_bak": 3.951412388582244}
{"id": "nat_111", "text": "The damp ground smelled of fresh rain.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.111886024475098, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.5028396197033262, "dnsmos_sig": 3.718377976478876, "dnsmos_bak": 4.212213414718827}
{"id": "nat_112", "text": "The cart was loaded with heavy stone.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 3.6827139854431152, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2189896099689768, "dnsmos_sig": 3.532810077091175, "dnsmos_bak": 3.974033254213526}
{"id": "nat_113", "text": "The long white rope coiled on the deck.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.0984601974487305, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.25612099589599, "dnsmos_sig": 3.59930323673735, "dnsmos_bak": 4.004008299225699}
{"id": "nat_114", "text": "The pine tree grew tall and straight.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 3.538808584213257, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.250186468237542, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5540565861721465, "dnsmos_bak": 4.029683610837368}
{"id": "nat_115", "text": "The coal burned slowly in the iron stove.", "audio_duration_s": 2.36843537414966, "utmos": 4.1117472648620605, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.451121856351869, "dnsmos_sig": 3.703740887170671, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1846544207531}
{"id": "nat_116", "text": "A gust of wind tore the sail apart.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.384005546569824, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3504465559169683, "dnsmos_sig": 3.605972226061823, "dnsmos_bak": 4.119683641757982}
{"id": "nat_117", "text": "The goat climbed steep rocky paths easily.", "audio_duration_s": 2.647074829931973, "utmos": 4.394289493560791, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.392840849808206, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6337474973671107, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1848731523948635}
{"id": "nat_118", "text": "The red sun sank below the flat plain.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 3.9119417667388916, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.355954951477216, "dnsmos_sig": 3.629892790716681, "dnsmos_bak": 4.141102944307977}
{"id": "nat_119", "text": "The wheat field swayed in the warm breeze.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.401795864105225, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0121876037145596, "dnsmos_sig": 3.375385783344389, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8157008932837813}
{"id": "nat_120", "text": "The thick fog rolled in from the sea.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.26587438583374, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.235268507793163, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5682701011419167, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9930032566012286}
{"id": "nat_121", "text": "The drum beat loud and steady all night.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.235103607177734, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.200892094929642, "dnsmos_sig": 3.476302007676555, "dnsmos_bak": 4.086746470470555}
{"id": "nat_122", "text": "The fox left tracks in the new snow.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 3.94584059715271, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2507196857894383, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5353896445975503, "dnsmos_bak": 4.061821070612676}
{"id": "nat_123", "text": "The light faded as the sun went down.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.217970848083496, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.198479897558087, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5033391008405252, "dnsmos_bak": 4.036013072071696}
{"id": "nat_124", "text": "A small boat drifted on the still lake.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.284066677093506, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.105586007059504, "dnsmos_sig": 3.428194646338379, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9492683952151966}
{"id": "nat_125", "text": "The cook prepared a fresh pot of soup.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.233671188354492, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.166927343292221, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4275928382125778, "dnsmos_bak": 4.061063146417951}
{"id": "nat_126", "text": "The old mill wheel turned in the stream.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 3.40669322013855, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1329434965618197, "dnsmos_sig": 3.56699165787824, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8435795073750008}
{"id": "nat_127", "text": "The long drought burned the crops dry.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.263976573944092, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4182644749184115, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6509747206302077, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1890475052604454}
{"id": "nat_128", "text": "The cool air smelled of pine and earth.", "audio_duration_s": 2.5541950113378684, "utmos": 3.4899518489837646, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3439309813557174, "dnsmos_sig": 3.617427923553026, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1484359692563695}
{"id": "nat_129", "text": "The child ran barefoot in the wet grass.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.3018951416015625, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4330821967579306, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6761449779818682, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1309401558687044}
{"id": "nat_130", "text": "A kite soared high above the park.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 3.875246286392212, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.28879888739988, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5872184751528304, "dnsmos_bak": 4.088596151897671}
{"id": "nat_131", "text": "The bridge shook as the truck rolled past.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.306026935577393, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3510233665305518, "dnsmos_sig": 3.60392345514364, "dnsmos_bak": 4.151558838041817}
{"id": "nat_132", "text": "The soft light fell on the open book.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.1957106590271, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1857828612994723, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4748429265953473, "dnsmos_bak": 4.040225258543445}
{"id": "nat_133", "text": "The crane lifted the heavy steel beam.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.349179267883301, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3769857860922072, "dnsmos_sig": 3.604626963730327, "dnsmos_bak": 4.160853880264399}
{"id": "nat_134", "text": "The strong horse pulled the loaded cart.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.160028457641602, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2912924448655922, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5220527907747177, "dnsmos_bak": 4.153836168268177}
{"id": "nat_135", "text": "The wind died down as night came on.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.0195722579956055, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.311761296421891, "dnsmos_sig": 3.577239269466081, "dnsmos_bak": 4.138695785660809}
{"id": "nat_136", "text": "The bird built its nest in the fork of the branch.", "audio_duration_s": 2.693514739229025, "utmos": 4.293113708496094, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4798385592244636, "dnsmos_sig": 3.720532150185261, "dnsmos_bak": 4.170034951463334}
{"id": "nat_137", "text": "The ice was thin near the river bank.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.332706451416016, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3895053265851396, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6184341193068548, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1479361569705295}
{"id": "nat_138", "text": "The fog lifted slowly as the sun rose.", "audio_duration_s": 2.414875283446712, "utmos": 4.224431037902832, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3362848011297577, "dnsmos_sig": 3.630538958313298, "dnsmos_bak": 4.0613449358954705}
{"id": "nat_139", "text": "The fire crackled in the stone hearth.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.0788044929504395, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4283530981192043, "dnsmos_sig": 3.676995522747605, "dnsmos_bak": 4.175299861578883}
{"id": "nat_140", "text": "The long bridge arched over the bay.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 3.9747517108917236, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.219322253893132, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4979875191563656, "dnsmos_bak": 4.033472978520691}
{"id": "nat_141", "text": "A cloud of dust rose from the dry road.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 3.7146496772766113, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.384389809635795, "dnsmos_sig": 3.660260068711473, "dnsmos_bak": 4.093006158326626}
{"id": "nat_142", "text": "The swift stream ran over smooth stones.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 3.965900182723999, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.347317706301187, "dnsmos_sig": 3.605942748782766, "dnsmos_bak": 4.097335502435524}
{"id": "nat_143", "text": "The torch cast shadows on the old wall.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.081610679626465, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2826915216294617, "dnsmos_sig": 3.583998390890365, "dnsmos_bak": 4.11514729301941}
{"id": "nat_144", "text": "The net was full of silver fish.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.240904331207275, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3056864440189044, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5619151034216343, "dnsmos_bak": 4.080643097198909}
{"id": "nat_145", "text": "The tall grain stood ripe in the field.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 3.8841161727905273, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.19544572138194, "dnsmos_sig": 3.510836478681939, "dnsmos_bak": 4.008258688096782}
{"id": "nat_146", "text": "The damp cloth wiped the dusty shelf.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.211978912353516, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.236081028037102, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5080621107579297, "dnsmos_bak": 4.117813694999666}
{"id": "nat_147", "text": "A mule team pulled the heavy plow.", "audio_duration_s": 1.811156462585034, "utmos": 4.340575695037842, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4243395267374135, "dnsmos_sig": 3.662921758968584, "dnsmos_bak": 4.186083344967487}
{"id": "nat_148", "text": "The old chair sat in the corner unused.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.067023754119873, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.270897743129441, "dnsmos_sig": 3.534611612724475, "dnsmos_bak": 4.099841400281071}
{"id": "nat_149", "text": "The rain fell steadily through the night.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7647165532879818, "utmos": 4.295353889465332, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.179780605090028, "dnsmos_sig": 3.499474753463248, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9525948885602213}
{"id": "nat_150", "text": "The lantern hung from the low beam.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.306231498718262, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2871396011849043, "dnsmos_sig": 3.601027881040442, "dnsmos_bak": 3.99921294646341}
{"id": "nat_151", "text": "The wind brought the smell of fresh hay.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 3.884662628173828, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.355414400142416, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5976595319613534, "dnsmos_bak": 4.152010173296159}
{"id": "nat_152", "text": "The stone path led to the small gate.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 4.221850395202637, "dnsmos_ovrl": 2.9587866509616414, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3379815964375665, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8195488637986363}
{"id": "nat_153", "text": "The loud noise startled the sleeping dog.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.292559623718262, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0069056515102113, "dnsmos_sig": 3.354532156469006, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8846786081957894}
{"id": "nat_154", "text": "The canoe glided across the glassy lake.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.279520034790039, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.32388019802708, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6017204767740028, "dnsmos_bak": 4.1138596533221605}
{"id": "nat_155", "text": "The long journey left them very tired.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.296952724456787, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.119204921077391, "dnsmos_sig": 3.41719562187225, "dnsmos_bak": 4.009421718016262}
{"id": "nat_156", "text": "The lark sang early in the damp morning.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.35014533996582, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.131972210525108, "dnsmos_sig": 3.547112347744225, "dnsmos_bak": 3.838900263433464}
{"id": "nat_157", "text": "The bees hummed in the tall clover.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.324179172515869, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.196300024117688, "dnsmos_sig": 3.524946923682979, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9884930170274604}
{"id": "nat_158", "text": "The thick ice covered the frozen pond.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.253287315368652, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3921972691570192, "dnsmos_sig": 3.637624453317541, "dnsmos_bak": 4.143987273150079}
{"id": "nat_159", "text": "The young deer grazed near the tree line.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.468256950378418, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.101570133188198, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4281688424955115, "dnsmos_bak": 3.943459534816518}
{"id": "nat_160", "text": "The heavy rains swelled the quiet river.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.262679100036621, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4197005893330905, "dnsmos_sig": 3.660827111741957, "dnsmos_bak": 4.172619270156898}
{"id": "nat_161", "text": "The steep cliff dropped to the blue sea.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.294388771057129, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0988261915608404, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3777059205242774, "dnsmos_bak": 4.034824488870341}
{"id": "nat_162", "text": "The bright sparks flew from the anvil.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 3.9653258323669434, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.192127659349979, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5920727411075526, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8726879730411246}
{"id": "nat_163", "text": "The cold spring fed the old stone trough.", "audio_duration_s": 2.461315192743764, "utmos": 4.017446994781494, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.328925213696013, "dnsmos_sig": 3.615702443034175, "dnsmos_bak": 4.094134111218489}
{"id": "nat_164", "text": "The wild geese flew south at dusk.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.254042625427246, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.093408973868449, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4851991337196466, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8011296005356154}
{"id": "nat_165", "text": "The soft moss covered the old log.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.233123779296875, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.283951076153499, "dnsmos_sig": 3.572575446336395, "dnsmos_bak": 4.07839997443718}
{"id": "nat_166", "text": "The sun shone warm on the stone bench.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 4.364078521728516, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4161467663881355, "dnsmos_sig": 3.658704508571418, "dnsmos_bak": 4.149699171195142}
{"id": "nat_167", "text": "The fresh bread smelled good in the kitchen.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 4.270707130432129, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.143036243201347, "dnsmos_sig": 3.3906000024043257, "dnsmos_bak": 4.087063592702864}
{"id": "nat_168", "text": "The frog leaped from the muddy bank.", "audio_duration_s": 1.5789569160997732, "utmos": 4.282164573669434, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2835330694546188, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5480855160326747, "dnsmos_bak": 4.134812699440912}
{"id": "nat_169", "text": "The tall ship sailed out of the harbor.", "audio_duration_s": 1.7182766439909296, "utmos": 4.173269271850586, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.383054153503573, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6410338138437424, "dnsmos_bak": 4.151073339703511}
{"id": "nat_170", "text": "The thick smoke rose from the chimney.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9040362811791383, "utmos": 4.3041887283325195, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2666771880264647, "dnsmos_sig": 3.579381381396475, "dnsmos_bak": 4.050921112578696}
{"id": "nat_171", "text": "The black cat sat on the warm sill.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 3.9541101455688477, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.25061001641706, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5077358517644623, "dnsmos_bak": 4.106983996181172}
{"id": "nat_172", "text": "The wide valley lay green and still.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2755555555555556, "utmos": 4.106271743774414, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.1618921799540636, "dnsmos_sig": 3.4533275211812087, "dnsmos_bak": 4.040268518582716}
{"id": "nat_173", "text": "The old well ran dry in late summer.", "audio_duration_s": 2.2291156462585033, "utmos": 3.835909366607666, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2742537654216375, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5462929872913778, "dnsmos_bak": 4.115504048236242}
{"id": "nat_174", "text": "The cold snap froze the small brook.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.327453136444092, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2951500043682946, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5860567820923293, "dnsmos_bak": 4.08764774642522}
{"id": "nat_175", "text": "The dew dried quickly in the warm sun.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.4677324295043945, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3255752549715996, "dnsmos_sig": 3.611031681199915, "dnsmos_bak": 4.102759101972779}
{"id": "nat_176", "text": "The sharp smell of pine filled the air.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9504761904761905, "utmos": 4.179399013519287, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.313527514226642, "dnsmos_sig": 3.566454594560056, "dnsmos_bak": 4.113737390985727}
{"id": "nat_177", "text": "The dog barked once and then was still.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.331938743591309, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.258195127801439, "dnsmos_sig": 3.531459776153356, "dnsmos_bak": 4.120124518643107}
{"id": "nat_178", "text": "The clay jar cracked in the dry heat.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.274443626403809, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.255769122901848, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5298653737584442, "dnsmos_bak": 4.07691245216964}
{"id": "nat_179", "text": "The loom wove cloth of many colors.", "audio_duration_s": 2.136235827664399, "utmos": 3.618901491165161, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3505697494440883, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6030665197838663, "dnsmos_bak": 4.148412291025228}
{"id": "nat_180", "text": "The brook flowed cold and clear all year.", "audio_duration_s": 2.507755102040816, "utmos": 4.22012186050415, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.0531602533788753, "dnsmos_sig": 3.433042983364034, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8182480092071147}
{"id": "nat_181", "text": "The frost burned the last of the corn.", "audio_duration_s": 2.043356009070295, "utmos": 4.279921531677246, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.205925175962217, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5008496930930284, "dnsmos_bak": 4.046289989445287}
{"id": "nat_182", "text": "The long canoe was carved from a log.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 3.579392433166504, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.3187504266193546, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5778761279989357, "dnsmos_bak": 4.150593376534439}
{"id": "nat_183", "text": "The roan horse ran best on flat ground.", "audio_duration_s": 2.36843537414966, "utmos": 4.208117485046387, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2603030364026626, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5629911155809197, "dnsmos_bak": 4.041915892465628}
{"id": "nat_184", "text": "The fern grew thick in the dark hollow.", "audio_duration_s": 2.3219954648526078, "utmos": 4.232844352722168, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.216224440543037, "dnsmos_sig": 3.532166917479312, "dnsmos_bak": 4.0468467440891605}
{"id": "nat_185", "text": "The sharp taste of the brine filled his mouth.", "audio_duration_s": 2.182675736961451, "utmos": 4.270430088043213, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.401588867459121, "dnsmos_sig": 3.661931348314538, "dnsmos_bak": 4.120990386181608}
{"id": "nat_186", "text": "The cart horse stood still in the rain.", "audio_duration_s": 1.8575963718820863, "utmos": 3.8427181243896484, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.269668667154383, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5489709049775486, "dnsmos_bak": 4.032934579267782}
{"id": "nat_187", "text": "The red brick house faced the park.", "audio_duration_s": 1.6718367346938776, "utmos": 4.172154426574707, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.26130957347424, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5392267797080486, "dnsmos_bak": 4.085873923032408}
{"id": "nat_188", "text": "The pale dawn light filled the valley.", "audio_duration_s": 1.9969160997732427, "utmos": 4.254796981811523, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.342587535947381, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5990587470445976, "dnsmos_bak": 4.141195134427221}
{"id": "nat_189", "text": "The dry wood burned hot and fast.", "audio_duration_s": 2.089795918367347, "utmos": 4.155881404876709, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2166989280731264, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6056488745837605, "dnsmos_bak": 3.8980303656395345}
{"id": "nat_190", "text": "The neural network achieved state-of-the-art performance on the benchmark.", "audio_duration_s": 3.7151927437641725, "utmos": 4.066941738128662, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.414668439152584, "dnsmos_sig": 3.654478234469855, "dnsmos_bak": 4.175854446385903}
{"id": "nat_191", "text": "Please confirm your appointment for tomorrow at three o'clock.", "audio_duration_s": 2.693514739229025, "utmos": 4.277307033538818, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2938070904329066, "dnsmos_sig": 3.642386267232206, "dnsmos_bak": 4.020475230656737}
{"id": "nat_192", "text": "The quarterly earnings report exceeded analyst expectations by twelve percent.", "audio_duration_s": 4.2260317460317465, "utmos": 4.320960998535156, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.380612538932646, "dnsmos_sig": 3.631659896487598, "dnsmos_bak": 4.155844349219063}
{"id": "nat_193", "text": "We regret to inform you that your flight has been delayed by two hours.", "audio_duration_s": 3.622312925170068, "utmos": 4.373075008392334, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4549173216857874, "dnsmos_sig": 3.6696082535227625, "dnsmos_bak": 4.181027818990673}
{"id": "nat_194", "text": "The temperature today will reach a high of seventy-two degrees Fahrenheit.", "audio_duration_s": 3.4829931972789114, "utmos": 4.41989278793335, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2910238438957355, "dnsmos_sig": 3.604374040166751, "dnsmos_bak": 4.012422425704901}
{"id": "nat_195", "text": "Your order has been shipped and will arrive within three to five business days.", "audio_duration_s": 4.133151927437642, "utmos": 4.036080360412598, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.2076280197697216, "dnsmos_sig": 3.568979582543573, "dnsmos_bak": 3.9114191915314516}
{"id": "nat_196", "text": "The new software update includes several important security patches.", "audio_duration_s": 3.575873015873016, "utmos": 4.344762325286865, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.4266229766198544, "dnsmos_sig": 3.7193860528013674, "dnsmos_bak": 4.091981645570879}
{"id": "nat_197", "text": "Press one for English, press two for Spanish, or stay on the line.", "audio_duration_s": 4.08671201814059, "utmos": 4.331098556518555, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.300882387454051, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5661706665822583, "dnsmos_bak": 4.09628441452788}
{"id": "nat_198", "text": "The meeting has been rescheduled to next Tuesday at two thirty PM.", "audio_duration_s": 3.8080725623582765, "utmos": 4.1143598556518555, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.370027548524137, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5957969104203342, "dnsmos_bak": 4.179620549706676}
{"id": "nat_199", "text": "Thank you for calling customer support. How can I assist you today?", "audio_duration_s": 3.3436734693877552, "utmos": 4.213076591491699, "dnsmos_ovrl": 3.278524955394265, "dnsmos_sig": 3.5229103125104015, "dnsmos_bak": 4.119832409202582}
